The first one is continuous architecture, sustainable architecture in an agile and cloud centric world, with Pier Purer.

10
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:52,869
and continuous architecture in practice, software architecture in the age of agility and devops,

11
00:00:52,869 --> 00:00:55,590
with Pier Pere and Owen.

12
